crud - reservat### =====================================================================
### SweetTreats Open API — Cekat — request siap-klik
### Pakai ekstensi VSCode "REST Client" (humao.rest-client):
### klik "Send Request" yang muncul di atas tiap blok ###.
###
### Ganti @token dengan token sandbox dari:
###   php artisan apiclient:issue Cekat sandbox
### Lokal: jalankan dulu `php artisan serve` (default 127.0.0.1:8000).
### =====================================================================

@base = http://127.0.0.1:8000
@token = ISI_TOKEN_SANDBOX_DI_SINI

# Tanggal dinamis (REST Client native):
#   {{$datetime "YYYY-MM-DD" 7 d}}  = 7 hari dari sekarang.
# Variabel ini di-evaluasi setiap "Send Request" → SELALU di masa depan,
# tak perlu edit manual. Format: "YYYY-MM-DD" + offset (N + unit: d/w/M/y).

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
### 1. AUTH GAGAL — tanpa token → harus 401 UNAUTHORIZED
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{base}}/apicekatdev/service_range?codes=SVC006

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
### 2. service_range (sukses) — min/max harga per kode treatment
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{base}}/apicekatdev/service_range?codes=SVC001,SVC002
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
### 3. customer_profile (sukses) — nomor sengaja "kotor" utk uji normalisasi
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
POST {{base}}/apicekatdev/customer_profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cabang": "Bintaro",
  "nama": "Budi Uji",
  "no_telpon": "+62 812-3456-7890",
  "treatment": "SVC001",
  "intent": "Stat_Leads"
}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
### 3b. customer_profile + field dokter (v1.2) — preferensi dokter lead
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
POST {{base}}/apicekatdev/customer_profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cabang": "Bintaro",
  "nama": "Budi Uji + Dokter",
  "no_telpon": "081234567899",
  "treatment": "SVC001",
  "dokter": "Elvia",
  "intent": "Stat_Leads"
}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
### 4. customer_profile (VALIDATION_ERROR) — no_telpon kosong → 422
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
POST {{base}}/apicekatdev/customer_profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "cabang": "Bintaro", "nama": "reza fauzi", "no_telpon": "082130292683" }

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
### 5. jadwal_dokter (sukses) — ganti cabang & tanggal sesuai data
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{base}}/apicekatdev/jadwal_dokter?cabang=Bintaro&tanggal=2026-05-20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
### 5b. jadwal_dokter — "dokter Bintaro hari Selasa siapa aja" (ringkas)
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{base}}/apicekatdev/jadwal_dokter?cabang=Bintaro&hari=selasa
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
### 5c. jadwal_dokter + sub_service (v1.1) — slot pakai durasi sub-treatment
###     Tanggal: dinamis = 7 hari dari sekarang (tak perlu edit manual).
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{base}}/apicekatdev/jadwal_dokter?cabang=Bintaro&tanggal={{$datetime "YYYY-MM-DD" 7 d}}&service=SVC001&sub_service=Control%20Metal%20Braces
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
### 5d. sub_service TANPA service induk → 422 VALIDATION_ERROR
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{base}}/apicekatdev/jadwal_dokter?cabang=Bintaro&sub_service=Metal
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
### 6. reservation (sukses)
###    Tanggal dinamis (+14 hari). JIKA gagal 409 SLOT_UNAVAILABLE →
###    jalankan Blok 5c dulu pakai tanggal sama, lihat slot kosong, lalu
###    sesuaikan start_hour/end_hour di sini (durasi=slot_interval).
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
POST {{base}}/apicekatdev/reservation
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cabang": "Bintaro",
  "nama": "Budi Uji",
  "no_telpon": "081234567890",
  "treatment": "SVC001",
  "date": "{{$datetime "YYYY-MM-DD" 14 d}}",
  "start_hour": "10:00",
  "end_hour": "10:30"
}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
### 7. reservation — sama persis Blok 6. Klik Blok 6 lalu Blok 7 berkali-kali:
###    tiap kali dokter lain yg bisa SVC001 & kosong dipakai; saat semua
###    penuh → 409 SLOT_UNAVAILABLE. pasien_baru_lama tetap "lama".
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
POST {{base}}/apicekatdev/reservation
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cabang": "Bintaro",
  "nama": "Budi Uji",
  "no_telpon": "081234567890",
  "treatment": "SVC001",
  "date": "{{$datetime "YYYY-MM-DD" 14 d}}",
  "start_hour": "10:00",
  "end_hour": "10:30"
}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
### 7b. GET reservation status (v1.4) — copy reservation_id dari respons Blok 6
###     lalu paste di akhir URL. Cek field "status" & "status_label".
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{base}}/apicekatdev/reservation/PASTE_RESERVATION_ID_DARI_BLOK_6
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
### 7c. GET reservation status — ID ngawur → 404 NOT_FOUND
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{base}}/apicekatdev/reservation/id-ngawur-12345
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### =====================================================================
### DISCOVERY ENDPOINTS (v1.3) — vendor refresh mapping otomatis
### =====================================================================

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
### 8. GET /treatments — daftar service + sub_service + kode aktif
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{base}}/apicekatdev/treatments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
### 9. GET /branches — daftar cabang aktif
### ---------------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{base}}/apicekatdev/branches
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
